  "releaseNotes": "- Add .NET 11 support\n      - Remove .NET 8 support\n      - Add provider and sitemap abstractions for custom data sources\n      - Add normalized URL and key lookup\n      - Add breadcrumbs, ancestor, descendant and visibility helpers\n      - Add optional role-based security trimming\n      - Add custom access evaluators and recursively filtered navigation trees\n      - Add injectable current-node resolvers for dynamic routes\n      - Add optional atomic XML sitemap reloading\n      - Add source-aware startup validation\n      - Update project dependencies November 23rd 2026",
